{% doc %}
  The cart icon: a tote, not a trolley. Nobody wheels a court around a
  supermarket.

  Decorative on its own, so it is hidden from assistive technology. The
  button around it carries the accessible name and the item count.

  @example
  {% render 'icon-cart' %}
{% enddoc %}

